  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef and Dhyey have become friends recently. Chef wants to test Dhyey's intelligence by giving him a puzzle to solve.\n\nThe puzzle contains an integer sequence A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​. The answer to the puzzle is the maximum of Ai%AjA_i \\% A_jAi​%Aj​, taken over all valid iii, jjj.\n\nHelp Dhyey solve this puzzle.",
    "constraints": [
      "2≤N≤1052 \\le N \\le 10^52≤N≤105",
      "1≤Ai≤1091 \\le A_i \\le 10^91≤Ai​≤109 for each valid iii",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (30 points):** 2≤N≤1,0002 \\le N \\le 1,0002≤N≤1,000",
      "**Subtask #2 (70 points):** 2≤N≤1052 \\le N \\le 10^52≤N≤105"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of each test case contains a single integer NNN.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print a single line containing one integer — the answer to the puzzle.",
